msgstr "Hermes 需要进一步确认"

msgid "Hermes runs as a local gateway; this page manages the service, and the Chat page talks to it."
msgstr "Hermes 以本地网关形式运行；本页面用于管理服务，对话页面通过该网关与 Hermes 通信。"

