msgstr "正在中断…"

msgid "Keep this on loopback. Hermes requires an authentication provider for any non-loopback bind, and the LuCI chat page reaches the gateway locally regardless."
msgstr "请保持使用回环地址。绑定到非回环地址时 Hermes 需要身份验证提供程序，而 LuCI 对话页面始终通过本机访问网关。"

