msgid "Stored in %s with mode 0600, not in UCI. Existing keys are never displayed — leave a field blank to keep it unchanged."
msgstr "存储在 %s 中，权限为 0600，而非存储在 UCI 中。现有密钥不会显示；将字段留空即可保持不变。"

msgid "System"
msgstr "系统"

msgid "The chat bridge (hermes-chatd) is not running, so the Chat page will not work."
msgstr "对话桥接服务（hermes-chatd）未运行，因此对话页面无法使用。"

msgid "The chat bridge is not connected to the gateway."
msgstr "对话桥接服务未连接到网关。"

msgid "The chat bridge is not running."
msgstr "对话桥接服务未运行。"

msgid "The chat bridge is running but not connected to the gateway%s. The Chat page will not work until it is."
msgstr "对话桥接服务正在运行，但尚未连接到网关%s。连接成功前对话页面无法使用。"

msgid "The contents of %s. Hermes owns this file and rewrites it itself, so what you enter may come back reformatted. A backup is kept as %s on every save."
msgstr "这里显示 %s 的内容。该文件由 Hermes 管理并可能自行重写，因此输入内容可能被重新格式化。每次保存时都会在 %s 保留备份。"

msgid "The gateway is bound to %s rather than loopback. Hermes then requires an authentication provider, and the port becomes reachable from your network — the LuCI chat page does not need this."
msgstr "网关绑定到了 %s 而不是回环地址。此时 Hermes 需要身份验证提供程序，并且该端口可从网络访问；LuCI 对话页面不需要这样设置。"

